### Step 7: Deployment & Nginx Config (`nginx.conf`)
```nginx
upstream fastapi {
    server app:8000;
}

server {
    listen 443 ssl;
    server_name csv-table.example.com;

    ssl_certificate /etc/ssl/certs/app.crt;
    ssl_certificate_key /etc/ssl/private/app.key;

    location /table {
        proxy_pass http://fastapi;
        proxy_set_header Host $host;
        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
    }

    location /health {
        proxy_pass http://fastapi;
    }
}
```

## 6. Security Considerations
| Risk                      | Mitigation Strategy                                      |
|---------------------------|----------------------------------------------------------|
| Path Traversal            | Resolve & validate CSV path against allowed directories  |
| CSV Injection             | Strip/escape `=`
